 gradual future faction of their flesh  we can also learn from loretta's mastery  spell that the hollow tree was used as a  place of refuge for the albanorics  sorcery used by loretta knight of the  hollow tree developed by loretta after  her long bloody journey to seek out a  place where the albanorics could live in  peace loretta once a royal carion knight  went on a journey in search of a haven  for the albanorics and determined that  the hollow tree was their best chance of  eventual salvation i wanted to include  this information of loretta because it  tells us that she gave up her service to  the carrion royalty and devoted herself  fully to the hollow tree further telling  us that the hollow tree and the twins  stood for something that people greatly  believed in more so than the golden  order or the carrion royalty let's talk  about what we think happened to mykola  and melania after the shattering of the  elden ring melania fought her way  through the lands between to reach radon  on this journey she defeated godric but  decided not to kill him we know this  from a conversation we have with kenneth  height leslie godrick's nothing more  than a jumped up country bumpkin lord oh  don't make me laugh  first he hid himself amongst the women  folk to flee the capital then hid from  radon in that castle  then he insulted melania lost to her in  battle only to lick her boots rather  than die like a man we know that melania  and radon fought in caled where she  unleashed the full force of the scarlet  rot ending their great battle in a draw  between the two of them the description  of the ashes of finlay one of the clean  rot knights indicates that finlay  carried a slumbering melania back to the  hollow tree after the battle with radon  and as we can see from the world map a  journey from caled back to the hollow  tree is a very  long trip especially to carry a demigod  imperian so props to finlay who i'd  imagine was the strongest of the clean  rot knights we know mikala was taken  from the hog tree by moog and the hollow  tree is either already dying or begins  to die after mikola is taken from it  moog attempts to make mykola his consort  but fails and mykolo remains  unresponsive in his cocoon this cocoon  was clearly taken from this location at  the roots of the hollow tree where we  meet in battle against melania melania  was waiting here for mykolo's return  it's not clear but we can guess that  when we see her she's still deeply  sleeping and recovering from her battle  with radon i would assume that  unleashing the scarlet rot is very  exhausting it is also unclear if she  knows the nature of mikala's  disappearance from our battle with her  it seems as though melania is blind  since the scarlet rot appears to have  spread over her eyes this is just  speculation obviously there's nothing  that indicates that she is blind since  it really feels like she can see just  fine when she fights against us my flesh  was dull gold  and my blood  rotted  corpse after corpse left in my wake  as i awaited  his return the phrasing from her here  sounds as though she went out to fight  radon while waiting for mikala to return  it doesn't seem like she's leaving  corpses of soldiers in the hollow tree  while she waits for mykola and in my  wake i think is in reference to her  traveling to caleb finally we know at  some point mykola made a promise to  melania as we can tell from her armor  set which reads my brother will keep his  promise he possesses the wisdom the  allure of a god he is the most fearsome  emperian of all man i just know we're  going to fight mickeleh in some dlc or  hopefully we don't fight against him i  don't know he seems like a good guy all  i know is the the dlc of elden ring is  gonna be awesome this description could  possibly indicate something else but  it's likely just his general promise to  cure her of her scarlet rot so all of  this information leaves me with one  question why does melania decide to  fight radon maybe it was to acquire his  great rune but if that's the case why  would melania decide to spare godric is  it possible that just like with radon  the scarlet rot spreads to her brain and  makes her disillusioned with her  decision making though this also seems  unlikely since her devotion to mikala  seems to remain completely unwavered  it's also possible that she decided to  fight radon to stop him from holding the  stars at bay since most of melania's  intentions are in service of mykola it's  possible that mikla's destiny is held  back by the stars in some way just like  ronnie again all of this is speculation  let me know what you think down in the  comments but in my opinion i believe  melania was searching for mikala she  went on a long journey battling other  demigods in her search like godric and  was ultimately stalemated by radon and  was brought back to the hog tree to  recover so that she could go out again  and try and find mykla it seems to me  that mykola's disappearance was a  complete mystery we can see the  mannerisms of the hologree soldiers here  who seem to be searching for something  they're spread out randomly looking  everywhere in search of mykola if  melania and these soldiers knew that  mikala was taken forcefully from the  hollow tree by moog they'd likely be  more desperate to leave the hollow tree  in search for him to bring him back so  somehow  moog plucked the cocoon of mykola out of  the hollow tree and disappeared without  a trace now most people usually see  melania as the villain and radon is the  hero and while i still believe radon to  be a vitally important character in his  own ways and you should go watch my full  video on his lore if you want to know  more but i don't believe melania to be  this villain she nuked caleb with the  scarlet rot that's obviously bad and it  makes caleb and its inhabitants look  terrifying so we symbolize these scary  things with melania since she caused it  to happen but we should 